==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Dwebble|11}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*'''Sand Spray''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Wormadam|44}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

